    "",
    "与 config/collusion_presets.json (chestmnist 专用) 的区别:",
    "  - 密钥矩阵根目录: save/key_matrix_collusion_cifar100",
    "  - dataset: cifar100 (in_channels=3)",
    "",
    "为什么要单独一份: 密钥矩阵目录 <base>/<model>/client<N> 不含数据集维度,",
    "而卷积层形状随 in_channels 变化 (chestmnist=1, cifar100=3),",
    "因此两种数据集的密钥矩阵不能放在同一目录。",
    "",
    "用法:",
    "  python train_key_matrix.py --model_type alexnet --client_num 10 \\",
    "      --profile collusion --collusion_K 3 --dataset cifar100 \\",
    "      --save_dir save/key_matrix_collusion_cifar100",
    "",
    "  python main.py --collusion_only --dataset cifar100 --model_name alexnet \\",
    "      --collusion_size 3 --collusion_leak_stage post_training \\",
    "      --key_matrix_dir save/key_matrix_collusion_cifar100 \\",
    "      --collusion_size_configs config/collusion_presets_cifar100.json"
  ],

